.TH "PACE TRAINING" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace training Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-training \- Training load and performance metrics.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace training
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Training load and performance metrics.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBstatus\fP
  Training status (load, balance, focus).
  See \fBpace training-status(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBstatus\fP command.
.PP
\fBreadiness\fP
  Daily training readiness score.
  See \fBpace training-readiness(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBreadiness\fP command.
.PP
\fBrace-predictions\fP
  Predicted race times across distances.
  See \fBpace training-race-predictions(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBrace-predictions\fP command.
.PP
\fBendurance\fP
  Endurance score (aerobic capacity).
  See \fBpace training-endurance(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBendurance\fP command.
.PP
\fBfitness-age\fP
  Estimated fitness age.
  See \fBpace training-fitness-age(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBfitness-age\fP command.
.PP
\fBhill-score\fP
  Climbing ability score.
  See \fBpace training-hill-score(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBhill-score\fP command.
